  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia Multi-Partner workshop - November 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a CAFOD facilitated 3 day workshop in Bogota, with the following objectives: Carry out an analysis of the current context and peace negotiations; Review of CAFOD&#x2019;s Regional Strategy Plan priorities and share work of interest from other CAFOD partners in the region (e.g. participatory water monitoring in Peru etc) with input from FUNVIPAS; Share information about REPAM; Discuss tools such as stories of change / testimonies to improve partners&#x2019; qualitative monitoring methodologies; training on Child Protection.</narrative>
  </description>
